            "description": "# [haberpy](https://pypi.org/project/haberpy/)\r\n\r\nSon dakika haberleri \u00c3\u00a7ekebilmenize yarar.\r\n\r\n## Installation\r\n\r\nUse the package manager [pip](https://pip.pypa.io/en/stable/) to install foobar.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\npip install -U haberpy\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom haberpy import Haberler\r\n\r\nhaber = Haberler()\r\n\r\n# returns 'text'\r\ntext = haber.text(limit=1)\r\n\"En g\u00c3\u00bcncel haber metinlerini \u00c3\u00a7eker.\"\r\n\r\n# returns 'img'\r\nimg = haber.img(limit=1)\r\n\"En g\u00c3\u00bcncel haberlere dair g\u00c3\u00b6rselleri \u00c3\u00a7eker.\"\r\n\r\n# returns 'ornekler'\r\ntext, img = haber.text_and_img(limit=1)\r\n\"G\u00c3\u00bcncel haberlerin metin ve g\u00c3\u00b6rselini tek istekte verir.\"\r\n\r\n######### Sport #####################\r\n\r\nfrom haber.sport import Sport\r\n\r\nspor = Sport()\r\n\r\n# returns 'title'\r\nspor.title(limit=1)\r\n\"G\u00c3\u00bcncel spor haberine ait ba\u00c5\u0178l\u00c4\u00b1\u00c4\u0178\u00c4\u00b1 \u00c3\u00a7eker.\"\r\n\r\n# returns 'about'\r\nspor.about(limit=1)\r\n\"G\u00c3\u00bcncel spor haberine ait i\u00c3\u00a7eri\u00c4\u0178i \u00c3\u00a7eker.\"\r\n\r\n# returns 'img'\r\nspor.img(limit=1)\r\n\"G\u00c3\u00bcncel spor haberine ait g\u00c3\u00b6rseli \u00c3\u00a7eker.\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## License\r\n\r\n[MIT](https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/)\r\n\r\n## Contact\r\n\r\n[Telegram](https://t.me/ReWoxi) - [Github](https://github.com/Meinos10) - Discord: ```emree#0010```\r\n",
